  "solution_ref": "$-12k^2+24k=12$ → $k=1$. $v=-4t^2(t-3)\\le0$ ($3\\le t\\le4$). $\\int_3^4(4t^3-12t^2)dt=[t^4-4t^3]_3^4=27$",
